{"4340380": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Launch President", "steam_appid": 4340380, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch President is a short and experimental action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch the president and see how far he goes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on simple controls and physics-based gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is designed to be played in short sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- One-button controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physics-based action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Short playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch President is a short and experimental action game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The goal is simple:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Launch the president and see how far he goes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game focuses on simple controls and physics-based gameplay.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is designed to be played in short sessions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- One-button controls</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Physics-based action</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >- Short playtime</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "President Launcher is a simple physics-based sandbox game created purely for fun. Tap the launch button to send the president flying into the air, and use sliders to adjust gravity and launch power. There are no goals or rules—just experiment the unpredictable, over-the-top physics simulation.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4340380/4d89aba288f175aa3485501b7ff55b23a5133e01/header.jpg?t=1770336165", "cap